 To do so the plasma-version binary package ships a Provides:
 plasma-version-base-MAJOR.MINOR virtual package where MAJOR and MINOR
 represent the main plasma release that we want all installed Plasma
 packages to match. Plasma packages can then depend on the
 plasma-version-base-MAJOR.MINOR matching their main Plasma version.
